acknowledge, < AS. ''oncnāwan'', perceive, know, < ''on''- for ''and''- (= Gr. ἀντί, against, back, = Goth. ''anda''-), + ''cnāwan'', know: see ''a''-<sup>5</sup> and ''know''.] To recognize; acknowledge; confess.
